From 37c96f89f931739380ee6329051fd1613b575202 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reilly Brogan <reilly@reillybrogan.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:30:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] common: include <cstring> in dynamic_library.cpp

std::strncmp() was only reachable through a transitive include that
newer libstdc++ releases no longer provide.

Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-15
---
 src/common/dynamic_library.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/common/dynamic_library.cpp b/src/common/dynamic_library.cpp
index 566fbed..aaa35d4 100644
--- a/src/common/dynamic_library.cpp
+++ b/src/common/dynamic_library.cpp
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 // SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2019 Dolphin Emulator Project
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
 
+#include <cstring>
 #include <string>
 #include <utility>
 
